cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  bioc-registry: the Bioconductor package registry
message: If you use this software or its data, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Sean
    family-names: Davis
    email: seandavi@gmail.com
  - name: The Bioconductor Core Team
    website: https://bioconductor.org/about/core-team/
repository-code: https://github.com/seandavi/bioc-registry
url: https://bioc-registry.seandavi.workers.dev
abstract: >-
  An HTTP API and data plane producer for Bioconductor package metadata:
  build and check state observed from r-universe, gated propagation of
  packages and binary artifacts, provenance, a queryable Parquet archive,
  and an installable CRAN-layout repository.
keywords:
  - bioconductor
  - r
  - bioinformatics
  - package-repository
  - metadata
  - provenance
license: Apache-2.0
